WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:07.700
I imagine a world in which the vast
majority of people wake up every single

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.840
morning inspired to go to work and come
home every single day fulfilled by the

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:16.550
work that they do. My hope is that this
course takes us a little further down

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:20.810
that path. If people learn their WHY, it
makes them better qualified and more

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:24.770
importantly more confident to choose the
careers, choose the jobs, and find the

00:00:24.770 --> 00:00:28.160
companies that create environments in
which they are more likely to be

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:32.870
inspired and feel fulfilled. And that's
the goal. The discovery of WHY was not an

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:37.399
academic exercise or commercial exercise.
It was something deeply, deeply personal.

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:42.469
I had a small business and after a few
years had lost my passion for what I was doing.

00:00:42.469 --> 00:00:46.010
People gave me silly advice like
"do what you love." I was doing the same thing,

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:49.190
I didn't love it anymore.
Thanks to the confluence of some events

00:00:49.190 --> 00:00:53.210
I discovered this naturally occurring pattern.
I knew what I did and I knew how

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:56.809
I did it but I couldn't tell you why.
And I realized I had to answer that question

00:00:56.809 --> 00:01:02.000
if I was gonna find that balance and
so I became obsessed with answering this question,

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:05.300
Why do I do what I do? 
Not only did it restore my passion, it restored it

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:09.020
to levels I'd never experienced before.
And as we do when we discover something beautiful

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:10.700
we share it with the people we love.

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:14.510
And so I shared it with my friends and
my friends started making crazy life changes.

00:01:14.510 --> 00:01:18.259
And they invited me to share it
with their friends and I would show up

00:01:18.259 --> 00:01:21.229
at someone's apartment and literally
give a little talk about this discovery I'd made.

00:01:21.229 --> 00:01:24.380
And I would just get more and more
invitations and this thing just

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:28.670
sort of spread organically and its
really changed the course of my life and

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:33.049
changed the course of my career where
now I'm completely devoted to spreading

00:01:33.049 --> 00:01:37.500
this idea and helping people either find
their passion or amplify it if they already have it.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:41.000
Having a job we love is a right
and not a privilege.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.900
It's not for the chosen few.

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:47.299
And so my hope is to share
this idea with as many people as possible

00:01:47.299 --> 00:01:52.880
so that indeed saying "I love my
job" becomes the standard and not the exception.

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:57.200
I used to do the WHY Discoveries myself
that's how it began.

00:01:57.200 --> 00:02:01.579
I would actually help my friends
learn their WHY. I used to sit down with them

00:02:01.579 --> 00:02:06.049
and go through this process, it took
hours, where I'd ask them all about their

00:02:06.049 --> 00:02:09.950
life and try and see the patterns to try
and discern their WHY. And it was great

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:13.520
and highly effective but I was the only one
doing it, so I shared it with others

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:16.100
and there was a few of us doing it
but still, you know,

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:19.850
there was this desire to do it
with more people and so we took this process

00:02:19.850 --> 00:02:23.810
that I used to do manually and
took everything that I learned and put

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:27.410
it in this online course but it's
basically the exact same thing I used to

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:31.160
do by myself so it's it's really fun to see
it come to life in a course.

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:35.360
The best thing about the WHY is that
it's a biological constant, it has nothing to do

00:02:35.360 --> 00:02:39.170
with what we do. It's based on the
biology of how we make decisions and

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:43.160
what drives us and motivates us,
which means that it doesn't matter whether

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:46.500
you're retired or whether you're a
student, it doesn't matter what industry you're in.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:50.270
This course is designed to
help people understand what makes them tick

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:53.990
and what drives them, what inspires them,
And that's why I'm really proud of this.

00:02:53.990 --> 00:02:57.400
I mean this will give people something
to grasp on to and find inspiration

00:02:57.400 --> 00:03:00.260
and fulfillment and in everything they do,
hopefully for the rest of their lives.

00:03:00.260 --> 00:03:03.890
All you need to do is
have the will and the desire to want

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:07.670
to understand what drives and inspires you.
And that's why we designed this course.

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:11.900
It's designed for people to find that thing,
to understand the thing that

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:15.100
gives them their true north 
and helps them wake up every single morning

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:20.650
inspired and come home fulfilled, 
I mean, who wouldn't want that?

